SUMMARY:Special Event: Sejoe
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Affectionately known as the "Haitian Dave Chappelle" by the Hai
 tian community\, Sejoe whose real name is Joseph Ducasse\, is a Haitian-Ame
 rican comedian renowned for his groundbreaking contributions to comedy\, pa
 rticularly through his stand-up special "Nou Chaje ak Pwoblèm" (We Got A L
 ot of Problems) on Amazon Prime. Born in Brooklyn and raised in Haiti\, Sej
 oe's early experiences were shaped by significant political upheavals\, inc
 luding a presidential coup d’état and an American military invasion\, wh
 ich influenced his unique comedic perspective .\n\nSejoe's comedic journey 
 began in earnest when he posted his first videos online in 2009\, seeking t
 o cope with his decision to move away from a medical career. Over time\, he
  built a substantial following\, with over 50 million views on his YouTube 
 channel and more than 250\,000 followers on social media. His comedy often 
 draws from his experiences growing up in Haiti and the cultural contrasts h
 e observed when he moved to the United States.\n\nCouple's Package includes
 :\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gr
 atuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent cus
 tomers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to 
 other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/speci
 al-event-sejoe/
